Simply Mirrors Plus
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Based on Simply Mirrors by NsTut (https://github.com/UpperMoon0/Simply-Mirrors).
Copyright (c) 2026 NsTut

Minecraft 1.21.4 Fabric port, reflection settings, players-only mode,
mirror-in-mirror rendering and fixes by malidev
(https://github.com/malithedeveloper/simplymirrorsplus).

Inspired by the mirror feature in Immersive Portals CE.
The standalone reflection renderer and planar-reflection mathematics are implemented in this project.
No Immersive Portals runtime or source files are bundled.
